# Mobile-only edits

The user’s current work is **mobile only**. Unless they explicitly say desktop or both:

- Put visual, layout, typography, and spacing changes inside `@media (max-width: 900px)` (or the project’s mobile breakpoint).
- Leave desktop base styles unchanged.
- Do not “improve” desktop while fixing mobile.
- When in doubt, scope the change to mobile only.
